    <name>[PENDING] Lt. Col. Thadd Blanton</name>
    <styleUrl>#pending</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>⚠ PENDING — marker may not yet be installed at this location.</b><br/><br/>This marker could not be found, so assuming it is still pending.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> 710 Fair Avenue, Gainesville<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Cooke]]></description>
    <Point><coordinates>-97.126998331103,33.630746289785,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Sam Callis Cemetery</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
