  <Placemark>
    <name>La Reunion</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Stevens Park Golf Course, Tee #6; on Hampton Road at intersection w/Old Orchard<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> 2100 W Colorado Boulevard, Dallas<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Dallas<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Site of the French Colony La Reunion, settled 1854. Placed by Jane Douglas Chapter, Daughters of the American Revolution. April 10, 1924]]></description>
