    <name>Site of Mission Nuestra Senora del Rosario</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Goliad State Park<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Goliad<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Goliad<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Site of Mission Nuestra Senora del Rosario, Established in 1754 for the Cujane Nation, Here Faithful Franciscan Missionaries Attempted to Christianize and Civilize the Indians of the Region Until 1794]]></description>
