    <name>Hutson B. Littlefield</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[from Gonzales, take 90-A SE about 13 mile, then go south on FM 443 about two miles.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Gonzales<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Gonzales<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Star and Wreath A volunteer soldier who fought in the Texas War for Independence lies here. Erected by the State of Texas, 1962]]></description>
