  <Placemark>
    <name>Gray County 50th Year Anniversary</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[200th Block of Kingsmill Street, Courthouse Square, Pampa<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Pampa<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Gray<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Lest We Forget; Gray County; 50th Year Anniversary; 1902-1952; Dedicated to our early day pioneers, through whose efforts Gray County was established. And who contributed so much to our 50 years of progress.]]></description>
