    <name>Claiborne West Home</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[From Seguin, east on US 90A East about 8 miles. House is on south side, between CR 212 (Dowdy Rd) and FM 1150. As of Sep. 2019, house is shown by appointment (call 830.372.4900).<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> 11115 Alternate 90, Seguin<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Guadalupe<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> RTHL medallion only]]></description>
