  <Placemark>
    <name>Ramirez Hall</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Corner of Portscheller Street and Main Plaza, Roma.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Portsheller Street on Main Plaza, Roma<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Starr<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Commercial structure with family home upstairs. On site bought 1872 by Lino Ramirez. Built by architect Heinrich Portscheller (1840-1915), who personally laid brick in fine detail around windows and doors. Three generations of Ramirez family occupied hall.]]></description>
